# Upstream's App Store review fixtures. They carried live IDS and APNs private
# keys, the handles registered to that account, and a real Mac's serial and
# MAC address, and include_str! baked them into every binary. Removed from the
# tree; ignored so a stray copy cannot come back.
hw_testing.plist
id_testing.plist

